cle timestamp changed after apparent wall-clock synchronization before the explicit restart, so that lifecycle comparison alone is not a reliable restart proof; the scheduled restart, subsequent boot timestamp change, and recovered behavior provide the stronger evidence.","Lifecycle collection does not support failed-service or package-health checks on OPNsense node1."]}
